## 1. System Snapshot

APEX is a multimodal AutoML pipeline with:

- FastAPI orchestration and contract endpoints in [api/run_api.py](../api/run_api.py).
- Streamlit front-end in [frontend/app_enhanced.py](../frontend/app_enhanced.py).
- Shared context persistence in [database/context_db.py](../database/context_db.py).
- Training and post-training lifecycle execution in [pipeline/training_orchestrator.py](../pipeline/training_orchestrator.py).

The architecture now includes explicit adapters and state helpers for:

- Path normalization and runtime storage constants.
- Meta-learning memory for model selection.
- Drift-to-monitor payload normalization.
- Retraining orchestration with persistent history.

